        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Mul-T-Lock Hercular Double Cylinder Deadbolt\r\n</b>\r\n<p>\r\nWith its truly unique design the MUL-T-LOCK Hercular deadbolt is truly spectacular high security lock. The Hercular is reinforced in just about every way possible. From a UL437 Listed Cylinder, to strong latch, to Bolt Bearing Mechanism, the Hercular Deadbolt will stop almost any attempt at forced entry. Strength usually does not mix with Flexibility. Not in the case of the Hercular, since it is the only Grade 1 Deadbolt with an adjustable backset. The Hercular deadbolt is true <b>high security lock</b> that exceeds all high security standards.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Double Cylinder (Key on both the inside and outside) Deadbolt and is available in 7 different finishes. Supplied with two (2) keys and owner key card. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/grade-1-mul-t-lock-hercular-single-cylinder-deadbolt\"><b>Hercular Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/grade-1-mul-t-lock-hercular-double-cylinder-captive-key-deadbolt\"><b>Hercular Double Cylinder Captive Key Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nMUL-T-LOCK's deadbolts are designed to provide superior door protection with uncompromised key control. The Key Card owner is the only person allowed to have the keys duplicated. Remove the worry about anyone making duplicates of your keys. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features </b> for Mul-T-Lock Hercular Double Cylinder Deadbolt\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI Grade 1 Locking Mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Bump Proof Lock Design</li>\r\n<li>Two (2) Mul-T-Lock 206SP Security Keyways</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 2 Keys</li>\r\n<li>UL Fire Rated Latch</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset fits 2-3/8\" and  2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>UL437 Drill and Pick Resistance Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Door frame strike reinforced with 3\" screws for extra security</li>\r\n<li><b>ADA Compliant</b></li>\r\n<li>MUL-T-LOCK's Patented Interactive Key Control System</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>High Security Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b>. Key from both outside and inside. Do not use on Fire or Emergency exit doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFit 1-1/2\" to 2\" thick doors. If your door is 1-3/8\" thick you must add an Extension Ring below. For doors 2-1/16\" to 3-3/4\" thick you must add a Thick Door Kit below.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Grade 1 Mul-T-Lock Hercular Double Cylinder Deadbolt",
                "description": "Mul-T-Lock Hercular Double Cylinder Deadbolts. High Security Grade 1 restricted key deadbolts. Double cylinder (key on both the inside and outside) with adjustable backset. Available in 7 different finishes. The Mul-T-Lock Hercular deadbolt is true high security lock that exceeds all high security standards.",
                "keywords": "MTL-206SP-HD2 Bump Proof Double Cylinder Deadbolts,  KW-HD2, Mul-T-Lock Hercular Double Cylinder Deadbolts, Mul-T-Lock Deadbolts, Security locks, Grade 1 locks, Mul-T-Lock High Security Double Cylinder Deadbolts,  commercial deadbolts, Mul-T-Lock Hercular deadbolts, pick proof locks, High Security Double Cylinder Deadbolts,  Mul-T-Lock restricted keyway, Mul-T-Lock restricted keys,"
            },
